            <div xml:id="d514">

                <pb facs="0539" n="535" sameAs="frus:frus1939v03/pg535"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">894.24/654: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in France</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Bullitt</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1939-05-05T17:00:00-04:00">May 5, 1939—5
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>337. Your 874, May 3, 5 p.m., last paragraph. The Department desires that in your
                    discretion you endeavor to discourage proposed approach by inviting attention of
                    appropriate quarters to considerations mentioned in the penultimate paragraph of
                    enclosure to the Department’s instruction no. 1455 of May 1.<anchor n="9"
                        xml:id="d514-f1"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
